<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello </span>{!Contact.FirstName}<span style="font-size: 12pt;">,&nbsp;</span></font><div style=""><br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">As we highlighted in prior correspondence, your account is currently </span></font>{!Case.Past_Due_Balance__c}<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;past due.&nbsp; We have given you&nbsp;</span>different</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;repayment options to get the account brought current but have not heard back from you.&nbsp; In order to avoid incurring late fees and penalties we need to get the account brought current.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If we do not hear back from you within a week we will schedule the payments&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">necessary</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;to bring your account current.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><br style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">We look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><br style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you,</span></span></span></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); 